  "content": "\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<p><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_0f23b443-325e-468f-8e01-482f6866342d.png\" width=\"818\" height=\"218\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/MVZqYCNqkD\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_26821405-fe2c-4654-80ec-2771e9232600.png\" width=\"125\" height=\"34\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">沉浸治療模組全面改造了《Minecraft》的治療系統，加入真實機制。製作繃帶、藥丸和急救包，種植藥草，從基礎療法逐步進展到進階醫療用品，所有治療均基於時間計量並帶有副作用。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">尋找新的 Medicinal Herb（治療草），製作全新物品，在困境中治癒傷口或助你脫困。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_afde7334-c47d-4445-bcf5-1cbbfb6c9f61.png\" width=\"553\" height=\"79\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_78d5d706-0c4a-4341-8cc8-d6bba567172d.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_70944650-ed61-4593-9d2b-72f586d92d7b.png\" width=\"321\" height=\"379\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">所有全新配方：</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_b64a8459-6c71-451d-80cf-347d034a370d.png\" width=\"241\" height=\"113\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_5fb7e709-cfd0-4e25-a325-9eb3b853f0ea.png\" width=\"241\" height=\"113\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_edf42256-6dba-4b84-9741-9421361f3b6b.png\" width=\"241\" height=\"113\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_3bb0dee2-0ac9-4c87-86a3-f518f82616ed.png\" width=\"241\" height=\"113\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_013213d5-2dc0-44c2-a50f-0935ffc38bd1.png\" width=\"241\" height=\"113\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_a55ff98d-38f4-4918-9be8-9f26e3ba5ba5.png\" width=\"241\" height=\"113\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_6629d342-0010-4741-a96c-3512a33e1cab.png\" width=\"241\" height=\"113\"></p>",
